# PLACE SCRIPT of queens, the six acts, on the clean notebook, in the form of LAW-OF-A-PLACE.md (the cqo): CELL from 0 among the code cells, LINE and COL from 1, the cursor on the word first character
# written FROM THE PROGRAM (developer_02 2026-11-23), never from a server answer: occurrences are whole-word, case-blind (Pascal), outside strings and brace comments, scoped by the lines of the routine that declares the name
# the outline lists the globals, routines and types each cell declares in the order of the text (Variable, Function, Struct with its fields as Field children), a nested routine under its parent; never the program heading, a local or a parameter (the cqo ruled 15:0x)
# a function name assigned in its own body (total := 0) is a use of the function symbol, a write: references, rename and highlight include it (the cqo ruled 15:0x)
